-    |    ID C  R  G  B  Br C  Ch                                |
-    |    08 01 00 00 FF 32 00 C5                                |
-    |                                                           |
-    |    C = constant                                           |
-    |    RGB = color                                            |
-    |    Br= brightness                                         |
