+-/*------------------------------------------------------------*\
+-| Desk requires 2 sets of packets sent for the front and back  |
+-| Technically you could have both sides do something different |
+-| Not sure why you would though....                            |
+-| Cooler Master's software doesn't allow that anyways          |
