+-/*---------------------------------------------------------*\
+-| EVGASMBusControllerDetect.cpp                             |
+-|                                                           |
+-|   Detector for SMBus EVGA ACX 30 motherboards             |
+-|                                                           |
+-|   Balázs Triszka (balika011)                  21 May 2024 |
